    {
      "height": 500,
      "id": "6ab904a7780ab7e7",
      "styleAttributes": {
      },
      "text": "Total Stat Spread ranging to the 10's range (+-2) Feels good as all but the burner base was done without thinking of this number so likely a stat to stick with.\n\nI am in favor to the expanded Range up and down before any talking. This is largely do the diversity in stats allowing for stronger representation in Stat Strength for characters",
